{{!-- The class picker, laid out as the Scores Generator is: what the level does
      to the character's numbers, the class and the package it is read against,
      and what all of that leaves to choose. The three columns are built as
      markup by panels.mjs, which is the same code the generator's own boxes are
      built from — so a question asked here is worded as it is asked there.

      One root element: ApplicationV2 refuses to render a part that has two. --}}
<div class="acks-extras-classes-assigncols">

  <section class="standard-form panel acks-extras-classes-col">
    {{{levelColumn}}}
  </section>

  <section class="standard-form panel acks-extras-classes-col">
    <div class="acks-extras-classes-chargen">{{{classColumn}}}</div>
    <div class="acks-extras-classes-tplbox">{{{templateColumn}}}</div>
  </section>

  <section class="standard-form panel acks-extras-classes-col acks-extras-classes-picks">
    {{{picksColumn}}}
  </section>

</div>
